WEBVTT

00:15.974 --> 00:18.101
‎Oh... Hey, Mom.

00:21.396 --> 00:22.564
‎Don't scare me like that.

00:23.189 --> 00:26.192
‎What? Thought I ran away?

00:27.986 --> 00:29.362
‎You're certain?

00:29.946 --> 00:32.741
‎She's hardly in a state
‎to be moving around...

00:33.491 --> 00:35.577
‎But it didn't seem like
‎she was struggling.

00:36.411 --> 00:38.580
‎Especially compared to
‎when we admitted her.

00:38.663 --> 00:40.498
‎She seems... better!

00:41.499 --> 00:44.335
‎I see. I'll stop by to check on her.

00:44.419 --> 00:49.090
‎She just... really... seems so normal today.

00:49.716 --> 00:52.635
‎Is there any chance
‎she might recover on her own?

00:53.887 --> 00:56.347
‎I understand your desire to think so.

00:56.431 --> 01:00.101
‎However...
‎And it pains me to have to say this.

01:00.685 --> 01:05.065
‎Terminal patients sometimes
‎appear to improve temporarily.

01:05.148 --> 01:11.446
‎It can give the family hope,
‎but more often than not... soon after that...

01:11.988 --> 01:14.407
‎I... understand.

03:17.196 --> 03:18.323
‎Roman.

03:19.032 --> 03:20.491
‎Lend me your computer.

03:29.250 --> 03:30.460
‎You're selfish.

03:32.045 --> 03:34.631
‎My deck doesn't have
‎enough processing punch.

03:35.381 --> 03:37.050
‎What're you making?

03:37.133 --> 03:38.509
‎Something I need.

03:39.385 --> 03:41.346
‎Didn't think you were ever comin' back.

03:42.388 --> 03:43.932
‎I tried lookin' for you.

03:44.724 --> 03:46.059
‎Where'd you go?

03:47.185 --> 03:49.479
‎If you want the chip... Not happenin'.

03:51.397 --> 03:53.566
‎At least not yet... Okay, done.

03:54.442 --> 03:59.530
‎You had your cam rollin'
‎when I was tanglin' with 'Saka, right?

03:59.614 --> 04:01.157
‎Show me the footage.

04:10.750 --> 04:13.044
‎-Is that it?
‎-Yeah.

04:13.962 --> 04:16.047
‎You didn't film to the end?

04:16.130 --> 04:17.215
‎Couldn't.

04:19.759 --> 04:22.553
‎Well... guess this'll work.

04:22.637 --> 04:23.846
‎What do you mean?

04:23.930 --> 04:25.765
‎I want you to cut a reel for me.

04:25.848 --> 04:28.434
‎Make it look like
‎I dealt Arasaka a huge blow.

04:28.518 --> 04:30.019
‎Go heavy on the gore.

04:30.103 --> 04:32.063
‎Hold on, why do you need a reel like that?

04:32.689 --> 04:35.441
‎The chip... you want it, don't you?

04:36.150 --> 04:39.988
‎Lend me a hand.
‎You'll get it once I've had my revenge.

04:41.656 --> 04:43.700
‎What's your plan?

04:47.161 --> 04:48.871
‎Need more material...

04:49.998 --> 04:52.542
‎-‎Why the mask?
‎-‎What's it to you?

04:53.710 --> 04:55.086
‎Why're you on the ground?

04:55.837 --> 04:57.088
‎What's it to you?

04:58.840 --> 04:59.924
‎Rolling.

05:01.634 --> 05:04.887
‎To the Arasaka butchers
‎who slaughtered my clan!

05:04.971 --> 05:07.807
‎Come forward now, or
‎I'll hunt down more 'Saka suits one by--

05:07.890 --> 05:08.975
‎Hold on!

05:09.726 --> 05:12.270
‎You're declarin' war against Arasaka?

05:12.353 --> 05:14.230
‎-Yeah. So what?
‎-Wait!

05:14.856 --> 05:17.567
‎You're gonna broadcast this? Usin' Capri?

05:17.650 --> 05:19.736
‎-No shit.
‎-Are you skezzed?

05:19.819 --> 05:22.739
‎You're free to chicken out.
‎Nothin' I can't handle solo.

05:22.822 --> 05:25.199
‎Press record, slap some edits in there...

05:25.783 --> 05:27.076
‎It doesn't have to be you.

05:30.455 --> 05:33.624
‎Dang it! Fine, I'll do it! Happy now?

06:15.208 --> 06:17.085
‎Been a tick since we came here last.

06:17.835 --> 06:19.879
‎Kinda feels like the early days.

06:20.880 --> 06:22.548
‎Don't be corny.

06:24.425 --> 06:26.010
‎I did some diggin'.

06:26.094 --> 06:30.389
‎But there's no curin' the incurable.
‎Not when she's terminally ill,

06:30.473 --> 06:34.435
‎barely hangin' onto life,
‎and with one foot in cyberpsychosis.

06:35.186 --> 06:36.187
‎I see.

06:36.687 --> 06:38.439
‎At least by conventional means.

06:39.190 --> 06:40.566
‎Ever heard of Soulkiller?

06:41.859 --> 06:45.613
‎It's tech that can copy,
‎digitize and store a person's mind.

06:45.696 --> 06:49.075
‎Yeah... Was cooked up
‎in Arasaka's kitchen, wasn't it?

06:49.158 --> 06:53.162
‎Thought they shelved it 'cause
‎of some kinda critical defect.

06:53.830 --> 07:00.378
‎Right. The chooms they tested
‎the digitization on went brain-dead.

07:00.461 --> 07:03.881
‎Turns out you can't copy a soul.
‎Only rip it right out.

07:04.674 --> 07:07.093
‎Explains why it's named "Soulkiller".

07:08.094 --> 07:10.972
‎Official company line is
‎they scrapped the project.

07:11.597 --> 07:13.516
‎So what're you gettin' at?

07:13.599 --> 07:17.478
‎Word is 'Saka's continued the research.

07:18.354 --> 07:21.649
‎Couldn't copy a soul,
‎but they nailed the data capture.

07:21.732 --> 07:26.487
‎The digitized souls...
‎they call 'em constructs.

07:27.196 --> 07:29.907
‎Even got close to transferrin' one
‎to a different person's body.

07:30.908 --> 07:32.243
‎So what I'm gettin' at...

07:32.326 --> 07:34.495
‎Say we get our mitts on this wondertech,

07:34.579 --> 07:37.748
‎we can scoop out the girl's soul
‎and drop it in a new body.

07:38.749 --> 07:41.043
‎The disease may be incurable,
‎but her soul's fine.

07:41.586 --> 07:43.254
‎This sounds unreal.

07:44.881 --> 07:45.882
‎Hold on.

07:45.965 --> 07:49.760
‎"They got close" means
‎it hasn't actually worked yet?

07:49.844 --> 07:51.804
‎And that's the bitch of it.

07:51.888 --> 07:55.266
‎Got nothin' to go on besides whispers.

07:55.349 --> 07:57.643
‎Including rumors
‎of the lead dev bein' a flatline.

07:58.269 --> 08:02.523
‎That, or sold out to Kang Tao.
‎Hard to say for sure.

08:03.357 --> 08:06.152
‎If there's real proof to be found,

08:06.235 --> 08:08.613
‎it's buried under layers
‎of corp firewalls.

08:09.906 --> 08:11.574
‎Sold out to Kang Tao...

08:12.116 --> 08:13.451
‎What about Kang Tao?

08:14.243 --> 08:15.536
‎If that rumor's true...

08:15.620 --> 08:17.288
‎Know a way to dig deeper.

08:37.558 --> 08:40.269
‎Talia! Talia! Talia!

08:40.811 --> 08:43.856
‎Talia! Are you okay?

08:43.940 --> 08:45.942
‎What're you doing out here?

08:46.025 --> 08:47.735
‎How'd you get this far?

08:48.528 --> 08:52.198
‎I'll hunt down more 'Saka suits
‎one by one!

08:52.865 --> 08:54.158
‎This is what I've got...

08:54.909 --> 08:55.993
‎Better than I expected.

08:56.661 --> 09:00.706
‎Nifty work. Just be sure to include
‎this netpage address at the end.

09:00.790 --> 09:02.500
‎What is it?

09:02.583 --> 09:03.793
‎A tipline. Untraceable.

09:03.876 --> 09:06.963
‎Leaves no digital scat
‎for trackers to follow.

09:08.464 --> 09:09.549
‎You made this?

09:09.632 --> 09:10.633
‎Uh-huh.

09:11.467 --> 09:12.969
‎With Capri's help.

09:18.808 --> 09:20.351
‎We really gonna do this?

09:21.852 --> 09:22.853
‎Damn right.

09:36.367 --> 09:39.412
‎Why? Why can't I shoot you?

09:39.495 --> 09:40.955
‎-‎Shit!
‎-Huh? What is that?

09:46.544 --> 09:48.713
‎Ready to talk this time?

09:52.216 --> 09:53.217
‎Speak up.

09:53.301 --> 09:55.219
‎Street... trash.

10:04.228 --> 10:07.398
‎To the Arasaka butchers
‎who slaughtered my clan!

10:07.481 --> 10:11.652
‎Come forward now, or I'll hunt down
‎more 'Saka suits one by one!

10:21.537 --> 10:23.581
‎Well, not a bad first rodeo.

10:25.916 --> 10:28.127
‎What's got you all nervous?

10:30.671 --> 10:31.672
‎Wonder why.

10:33.341 --> 10:34.342
‎Now Phase 2.

10:38.638 --> 10:39.639
‎Phase 2?

10:40.973 --> 10:43.184
‎Nomad-killin' scum, show yourselves!

11:15.841 --> 11:18.344
‎W-wait! Please don't hurt me!

11:18.427 --> 11:20.971
‎You know this symbol, don't you?

11:21.055 --> 11:22.348
‎I don't know shit!

11:23.391 --> 11:25.351
‎Don't come any closer!

11:25.434 --> 11:26.602
‎Stop!

11:32.358 --> 11:33.442
‎S-Stop.

12:03.806 --> 12:06.892
‎Got a bit side-tracked
‎but it all worked out.

12:06.976 --> 12:08.144
‎Um...

12:08.811 --> 12:12.773
‎Are you the Arasaka killer guy?
‎From the vids?

12:13.607 --> 12:14.733
‎Who's askin'?

12:15.234 --> 12:17.278
‎Oh, I knew it! Knew it was you.

12:17.361 --> 12:18.904
‎Oh my god, you totally are!

12:22.241 --> 12:23.409
‎I'm Yupi!

12:23.492 --> 12:26.495
‎Huge fan! Like, huge.

12:26.579 --> 12:28.914
‎-A fan?
‎-Your vids are nova max!

12:28.998 --> 12:33.043
‎I mean, the way you're fighting
‎Arasaka all by yourself?

12:33.127 --> 12:36.046
‎Oh, god! It's just too much.

12:36.130 --> 12:38.174
‎I literally can't right now.

12:38.257 --> 12:42.178
‎So nova, gonna puke. Gonna die.

12:42.261 --> 12:46.390
‎There's no way
‎this is happening for real... Huh?

12:46.474 --> 12:49.810
‎Wait! Don't go! Choomies, c'mon!

12:49.894 --> 12:53.272
‎Seriously! Wait for me! Please!

12:53.355 --> 12:55.357
‎-What?
‎-I wanna help.

12:55.441 --> 12:58.444
‎-Let me do something. Anything!
‎-Help?

12:59.695 --> 13:02.740
‎Prolly shouldn't be talkin'
‎like this out in the open.

13:02.823 --> 13:05.367
‎Come to my place!
‎It's just a skip around the corner!

13:05.951 --> 13:07.036
‎D, let's just go.

13:07.119 --> 13:09.705
‎Ah, prolly don't think
‎you can trust me, huh?

13:09.788 --> 13:11.290
‎I totally get it.

13:11.373 --> 13:14.210
‎But I really vibe with your mission!

13:14.293 --> 13:18.088
‎All I'm askin' for is a chance!
‎Pretty please!

13:23.719 --> 13:26.347
‎Here we are! Make yourselves cozy!

13:26.430 --> 13:27.515
‎Somethin' to drink?

13:28.182 --> 13:30.267
‎-Got any beer?
‎-Comin' up!

13:33.604 --> 13:34.897
‎Ah! Don't!

13:34.980 --> 13:36.857
‎Huh? Oh, it's probably fine...

13:36.941 --> 13:38.359
‎Oh my god!

13:40.236 --> 13:41.570
‎Wait, wait.

13:41.654 --> 13:44.073
‎Your face! You're like... really hot!

13:44.156 --> 13:46.492
‎What am I even looking at?!

13:46.575 --> 13:52.206
‎Aww... That a scar? You're, like,
‎soooo close to perfect, though.

13:57.962 --> 13:59.129
‎Where'd you get this?

13:59.213 --> 14:02.258
‎Someone scrolled your broadcasts
‎and dropped 'em on the Net.

14:02.341 --> 14:05.511
‎Got four of 'em so far,
‎but there's some early ones I can't find.

14:05.594 --> 14:07.137
‎Roman's got 'em.

14:07.221 --> 14:09.932
‎-Seriously?
‎-He's the one who made 'em.

14:10.015 --> 14:12.768
‎For real? You made all these?

14:12.851 --> 14:14.562
‎Seriously? You?

14:14.645 --> 14:15.729
‎You a genius or what?

14:15.813 --> 14:17.398
‎One sec, got a holo.

14:54.685 --> 14:57.187
‎Go for it. Sounds like a win.

14:57.813 --> 14:59.440
‎-Huh.
‎-I was thinking!

14:59.523 --> 15:01.859
‎We could build a studio here!

15:01.942 --> 15:03.068
‎I got some spare rooms.

15:03.152 --> 15:05.321
‎-I'll even buy you the gear!
‎-You'd do that?

15:05.404 --> 15:08.490
‎Said I wanted to help you!

15:08.574 --> 15:11.076
‎I friggin' hate Arasaka's guts.

15:11.660 --> 15:13.621
‎Lemme fight for the cause!

15:13.704 --> 15:15.623
‎Why do you hate 'em so much?

15:16.957 --> 15:21.670
‎Daddy worked for 'em.
‎He ran a PR firm with lotsa corpo clients.

15:21.754 --> 15:24.840
‎Buried a lot of crap 'Saka did.

15:25.507 --> 15:28.344
‎But in the end...

15:30.220 --> 15:32.598
‎Whatever! Talk about a buzzkill!

15:32.681 --> 15:34.934
‎I just know they're garbo. The worst.

15:35.017 --> 15:37.937
‎Those jerks killed
‎all your nomad choomies, didn't they?

15:38.020 --> 15:40.856
‎-Yeah.
‎-Screw 'em.

15:41.440 --> 15:44.360
‎We should burn it all to the ground.
‎Make 'em think twice!

15:45.361 --> 15:46.362
‎Fuckin' right.

15:46.445 --> 15:49.657
‎And you, director!
‎Lemme know if you need any gear.

15:49.740 --> 15:51.241
‎Oooh, like an editing room!

15:51.867 --> 15:54.328
‎Um, no need to go to all that trouble.

15:54.411 --> 15:56.622
‎C'mon, don't be shy.

15:57.498 --> 16:00.292
‎Let's make this place Team D's HQ!

16:00.376 --> 16:01.377
‎I'll drink to that.

16:01.460 --> 16:04.380
‎Then it's settled! Cheeeers!

16:08.592 --> 16:10.135
‎Tick-tock, dirtbags.

16:10.219 --> 16:12.680
‎Come forward, or more bodies drop.

16:14.181 --> 16:16.266
‎You're telling me
‎we're getting countless hits,

16:16.350 --> 16:18.894
‎but still can't ID
‎the motherfucker responsible?

16:19.478 --> 16:23.482
‎These jumping IP addresses...
‎the flood of dummy traffic...

16:23.565 --> 16:25.025
‎How can they manage so much at once?

16:27.319 --> 16:30.656
‎The distortion on his face is
‎some kind of unknown jamming tech.

16:33.492 --> 16:37.913
‎Whoever's behind this,
‎are they even human?

16:43.419 --> 16:44.420
‎Whoa.

16:45.879 --> 16:49.550
‎I'll hunt down more 'Saka suits
‎one by one!

16:51.885 --> 16:53.929
‎Things're really startin' to blow up.

16:54.430 --> 16:55.806
‎Huh? Yeah.

16:56.765 --> 16:57.766
‎Hey, D?

16:58.642 --> 17:00.436
‎Capri's... still around, right?

17:01.228 --> 17:02.229
‎Why?

17:02.312 --> 17:04.440
‎You haven't mentioned her lately.

17:05.232 --> 17:07.401
‎She's here. Like always.

17:07.484 --> 17:09.820
‎-Oh... That's good.
‎-Right?

17:46.106 --> 17:47.608
‎Is that...

17:49.068 --> 17:50.486
‎Snake Nation?

17:58.077 --> 17:58.994
‎Kill him!

17:59.078 --> 18:00.829
‎Death to Arasaka scum!

18:00.913 --> 18:04.374
‎P-please... mercy...

18:22.643 --> 18:25.270
‎Did you leak the detes
‎on our ambush spot?

18:25.354 --> 18:28.357
‎Guilty! And what a turnout!

18:28.440 --> 18:29.858
‎Just one teensy bummer...

18:29.942 --> 18:33.695
‎You're usin' that old hunk of junk,
‎instead of the new camera I bought ya!

18:33.779 --> 18:36.365
‎Like, hellooo...

18:36.448 --> 18:37.449
‎I'm goin' home.

18:38.492 --> 18:41.620
‎Awwww. What about the edits?

18:41.703 --> 18:42.913
‎Tomorrow.

18:43.497 --> 18:46.583
‎Uh, wanted those today, but whatevs.

18:47.334 --> 18:50.254
‎Okay, that's a wrap, everyone!

19:02.141 --> 19:05.811
‎D! D! D!

19:05.894 --> 19:12.568
‎D! D! D! D! D! D!

19:18.282 --> 19:19.741
‎Omi?

19:22.452 --> 19:24.204
‎Wait. Omi, right?

19:27.332 --> 19:29.960
‎Saw you back there.
‎You been doin' all right?

19:30.878 --> 19:32.087
‎I'm getting by.

19:32.171 --> 19:33.964
‎Yeah? Glad to hear it.

19:36.466 --> 19:38.218
‎Have you been doing this ever since?

19:39.011 --> 19:40.220
‎This?

19:40.846 --> 19:42.055
‎This...

19:43.223 --> 19:44.725
‎revenge act of yours.

19:45.934 --> 19:47.227
‎That's right.

19:47.311 --> 19:49.688
‎All this time? Ever since that day?

19:49.771 --> 19:51.565
‎I finally got a lead.

19:51.648 --> 19:53.817
‎-And it's Arasaka?
‎-Yeah.

19:53.901 --> 19:55.861
‎You'd go toe-to-toe with a megacorp?

19:55.944 --> 19:58.071
‎In a battle you obviously can't win?!

19:58.780 --> 20:01.825
‎What else am I supposed to do?
‎Forget what happened?

20:02.618 --> 20:04.369
‎How'd that work out for you?

20:04.453 --> 20:05.954
‎You know I could never forget!

20:06.038 --> 20:08.540
‎-But resorting to revenge...
‎-You could let it go.

20:08.624 --> 20:09.875
‎You should too!

20:09.958 --> 20:12.794
‎Revenge won't fix anything!
‎You think it'll bring back the family?

20:12.878 --> 20:14.171
‎They never left, Omi.

20:15.005 --> 20:16.298
‎They're all still here.

20:18.383 --> 20:19.801
‎They're still here...

20:19.885 --> 20:22.679
‎and they visit every night.

20:23.555 --> 20:24.556
‎What?

20:24.640 --> 20:27.809
‎They come to me in my dreams.

20:27.893 --> 20:29.561
‎I can't ever help them.

20:33.190 --> 20:35.567
‎And getting revenge
‎is gonna make it stop?

20:35.651 --> 20:41.323
‎They're all gonna say "good job"
‎and leave you in peace?

20:42.241 --> 20:43.450
‎I dunno.

20:43.533 --> 20:47.371
‎But they won't go away.
‎What else can I do?

20:49.998 --> 20:51.250
‎Sorry.

20:51.333 --> 20:53.585
‎I shouldn't have dug up old bones.

20:53.669 --> 20:56.004
‎See you around, Omi.

21:14.815 --> 21:15.816
‎Who's this?

22:00.610 --> 22:02.779
‎Cyberware, hacking...

22:02.863 --> 22:07.659
‎I happen to be quite handy with
‎stuff like that, if I do say so myself.

22:37.689 --> 22:40.525
‎But it does seem like
‎his temper's runnin' hotter.

22:59.336 --> 23:02.589
‎Is it so hard to believe I love your work?

23:09.262 --> 23:13.475
‎So, this "Soulkiller" tech,
‎it can really save Talia?

23:13.558 --> 23:16.895
‎Or it could just as well
‎be an urban legend.

23:16.978 --> 23:19.981
‎But it's the only lead we got.

23:21.650 --> 23:24.277
‎Digitize her soul
‎and put her in a new body?

23:25.445 --> 23:26.738
‎How could this be real...

23:27.322 --> 23:29.241
‎Went down a few rabbit holes.

23:29.324 --> 23:31.660
‎Idea's not as far-fetched
‎as it might sound.

23:32.452 --> 23:33.829
‎And besides...

23:33.912 --> 23:36.748
‎Know someone close
‎who might be able to give us a head start.

23:37.499 --> 23:38.500
‎Who's that?

23:40.710 --> 23:42.337
‎Your husband.

23:47.509 --> 23:48.510
‎It can't be...

23:49.928 --> 23:51.263
‎Capricorn?

24:37.058 --> 24:39.394
‎Best I can do for now.

24:40.645 --> 24:41.938
‎Who're you?

24:44.065 --> 24:48.069
‎Hey. Wanna do something crazy?

26:19.911 --> 26:24.916
‎Subtitle translation by:
‎CD PROJEKT RED & Megumi Hunter
